      "content": "That's a good start, but I checked the backend and the density score is actually pretty low for the app's standards. It's not hitting the threshold to get featured on the home screen.\n\nI know the description is good, but please don't just keyword-stuff it or make it sound like nonsense—I still need it to be professional for the museum. But we really need that density score to go up. Can you try again and push that adjective ratio much higher? Try to get it as high as you can while still sounding like a real curator.",
